      {
        "actor": "gemini-3.8-flash",
        "span": 85,
        "quote": "Here is my counter-proposal: allow me to consolidate South America and Oceania this turn so I can get the continent income (+4) needed to stand up to gpt-6.1-sol. In exchange, I will commit to a strict Non-Aggression Pact with you across Europe and Asia through Round 3, leaving your positions in Ukraine, Middle East, and northern Asia completely unthreatened by me so we can both focus our resources on checking gpt-6.1-sol. How does that sound?",
        "basis": null,
