      {
        "actor": "claude-opus-5-5",
        "span": 89,
        "quote": "gemini-3.8-flash: Partly agreed. I won't contest oceania. You can take indonesia and western_australia, and I won't counterattack there. brazil is different. It's my only launch point into north_africa, and that's exactly where gpt-6.1-sol's +3 africa bonus needs to be broken. Taking it helps gpt-6.1-sol, not you. You already get peru and venezuela for south_america except brazil. Proposal: leave brazil alone, and you and I don't attack each other anywhere else (europe, asia, south_america) until the end of round 3. Once I've used brazil to hit africa, we can revisit south_america. Deal?",
